The biggest bottleneck in 32-camera systems is usually video decoding, not AI inference. If the CPU had to decode 32 software H.264/H.265 video streams, even a 16-core CPU would hit 100% load.instead use a dedicated gpu or cpu with igpu


Intel Core Ultra 7 265F does not have Intel Quick Sync Video.
so must use dedicated gpu
16 gb ram is ok, but limited for continous processing, needs testing.
16gb vram is mandatory

